// ADR-0071 step 2 (docs/effectset.md, #755): the ADR's Decision section
// requires a circular effectset member-reference chain to be a definition
// error ("循環は定義エラーとする"). Two hops (A -> B -> A) exercises the
// general cycle-detection path (not just direct self-reference).
effect Ask {
  Get -> Int
}

effectset A = { B }
effectset B = { A }
